[
  {
    "id": 2010,
    "date": "2018-10-09T00:07:39+00:00",
    "from": "Margaret DiBella",
    "text": "Hi Charlie, I haven't seen anything from you in a while. I hope all is well. I've been teaching a lot lately, and then I caught a cold from the kids, so now I'm just getting back to some kind of normal. Every weekend has been busy, so I haven't had the time to go up to Santa Fe and check out the few sites I have in mind for our reunion, but I will as soon as a couple of days open up.  I hope to have everything decided before the end of the year. What's going on with you? Margaret",
    "media": null
  },
  {
    "id": 2011,
    "date": "2018-10-09T00:36:17+00:00",
    "from": "tom_hanak",
    "text": "Hi [Margaret](tg://user?id=557364200), Chas is doing well. \n\nHe has some problems with his Telegram account  (can't sign in).\n\nWe are working on it.\n\nChas can communicate via his email for now.",
    "media": null
  },
  {
    "id": 2012,
    "date": "2018-10-09T16:02:07+00:00",
    "from": "Margaret DiBella",
    "text": "Thanks Tom! I hope you are all doing well. Cheers, Margaret",
    "media": null
  },
