  {
    "id": 1490,
    "date": "2018-10-16T11:50:53+00:00",
    "from": "bikepaths",
    "text": "Bayonne\n\nhttps://osmand.net/go?lat=43.493343&lon=-1.4751077&z=13",
    "media": null
  },
  {
    "id": 1491,
    "date": "2018-10-16T11:50:53+00:00",
    "from": "bikepaths",
    "text": "I am here.",
    "media": null
  },
  {
    "id": 1492,
    "date": "2018-10-16T11:50:53+00:00",
    "from": "bikepaths",
    "text": "Ourense\n\nhttps://osmand.net/go?lat=42.343647&lon=-7.867434&z=10",
    "media": null
  },
  {
    "id": 2014,
    "date": "2018-10-17T08:16:25+00:00",
    "from": "bikepaths",
    "text": "I am back, but Android device still needs service or replacement.\n\nTouch screen not functioning, so must type with Bluetooth mouse.\n\nNot so easy.\n\nAlso, battery needs replacement,  and there are lines across my screen.\n\nAbout to exit France and enter Spain today.\n\nHave plenty of photos of France to share later.",
    "media": null
  },
  {
    "id": 2015,
    "date": "2018-10-17T08:23:10+00:00",
    "from": "bikepaths",
    "text": "I would appreciate if everyone here would send me a personal message sharing their telegram contact number so i can add you to my telegram address-contacts list.",
    "media": null
  },
  {
    "id": 2016,
    "date": "2018-10-17T08:27:43+00:00",
    "from": "bikepaths",
    "text": "FYI, I am here now.\n\nSee the lovely bay?\n\nSo near to Spain border. \n\nhttps://osmand.net/go?lat=43.38748&lon=-1.6610967",
    "media": null
  },
  {
    "id": 2017,
    "date": "2018-10-17T08:32:57+00:00",
    "from": "bikepaths",
    "text": "France has been very beautiful, but not much social interaction because I don't speak the language.\n\nI really enjoy off season travel, and much prefer to always avoid tourist spots.",
    "media": null
  },
  {
    "id": 2018,
    "date": "2018-10-17T08:38:26+00:00",
    "from": "bikepaths",
    "text": "I am heading into mountains, and it doesn't look easy.\n\nFrance was so flat, and conveniences easy to find.\n\nRelative to all other countries, food prices are high.\n\nLooking back to the UK, food shopping was much easier and much less costly.",
    "media": null
  },
  {
    "id": 2019,
    "date": "2018-10-19T09:40:49+00:00",
    "from": "bikepaths",
